{
  "name": "Day 21 — AI Customer Support Desk (Chat + Email → Agent → Ticket)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 21: AI Customer Support Desk (Chat + Email → Agent → Ticket)\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: Gmail (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: OpenAI API key\n- Connect: Google Sheets (Google OAuth)\n- Connect: Slack (OAuth / bot token)\n- Day 16 wala \"Docs Search Tool\" (vector store) copy karke is agent mein ai_tool ki tarah jodo\n- \"Tickets\" tab headers: channel, user, text, reason, created\n- Slack mein #support channel\n\nCourse: Day 21 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "093bbea0-cd48-4337-a626-bf846c6aa250",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "public": true,
        "options": {
          "title": "Support 💬"
        }
      },
      "id": "b5252c98-7cb4-434b-a3b5-b51979189700",
      "name": "Website Chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "e20ee963-2126-44ce-aae5-bc1333a23538"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {
          "q": "to:support@yourcompany.com"
        }
      },
      "id": "d488072f-b064-42cf-a450-1904c155c741",
      "name": "Support Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dc4d5c00-e8f8-4513-a634-6dc27593c397",
              "name": "channel",
              "value": "chat",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "208a70b5-f1fa-4077-aca2-da9be698c090",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "={{ $json.sessionId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "9c9993c4-52ff-42fd-a186-6f7db35fdf8e",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6f211c8-5025-4b8a-aa47-870ca3d8ba66",
      "name": "Normalize Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c864cecd-d16b-4f02-a99a-ae59e2edc6f1",
              "name": "channel",
              "value": "email",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "70c36056-9d7a-4abb-a814-7366e72daddb",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "={{ $json.From }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "54859047-40df-4096-af71-fe81696a260d",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $json.Subject }}\n{{ $json.snippet }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "86b40ef2-4a78-4039-a591-f1f2d72c4ca1",
              "name": "message_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "29eb9b7b-424c-4851-a0a7-f0977c0d1f88",
      "name": "Normalize Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Tum \"YourBrand\" ke support agent ho. Policies:\n- Refund 7 din ke andar, unused product.\n- Delivery 3-5 working days.\n- Order status ke liye order ID maango.\nSirf in policies aur knowledge tool se jawab do. Agar customer gussa hai, refund ₹5000 se upar hai, legal baat hai, ya tumhe pakka nahi pata — sirf likho: ESCALATE: <ek line reason>"
        }
      },
      "id": "b0cc0ccd-94c6-475b-a1ed-116eb86dd1ec",
      "name": "Support Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bb915a0a-6327-44b6-adca-76f550061929",
      "name": "Agent Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.user }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "ea9f8b07-e567-4a37-ae3d-ec62b8fa2bf5",
      "name": "Agent Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        570,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "282981b1-c631-4c12-a27d-dc6d968f1c96",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output }}",
              "rightValue": "ESCALATE",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "startsWith"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1675ce1f-eb56-43f8-ad19-eea99b9a5322",
      "name": "Escalate?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bc776abb-5ee7-4d38-a9ac-c1a246647ff7",
              "name": "channel",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Email').isExecuted ? 'email' : 'chat' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "343aadc5-6656-4714-aebf-1db524899760",
              "name": "user",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Email').isExecuted ? $('Normalize Email').item.json.user : $('Normalize Chat').item.json.user }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0002da4f-665b-4e6b-aabd-06b0ded7e774",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Normalize Email').isExecuted ? $('Normalize Email').item.json.text : $('Normalize Chat').item.json.text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "371c89b3-0991-429f-ad1c-c916ddb8f9ae",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.replace('ESCALATE:', '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1ebdea5-0dbb-4790-a647-1fef185e48c7",
              "name": "created",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "136913ee-e120-4145-acd0-996b5385cad4",
      "name": "Ticket Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1040,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "PASTE_YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Tickets",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0ead1381-fffb-44cb-aea0-b4747b81d01f",
      "name": "Create Ticket",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1300,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#support",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=🎫 New ticket ({{ $('Escalate?').item.json.output }})",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b992f78f-36d9-4ccc-a429-8ab733e49bf7",
      "name": "Alert Team",
